kes you think  that whatever you negotiate with Trump  now for a North Korea deal is actually  going to be something that sustains it's  very very dangerous territory to be  going into and Trump is not getting us  into that haphazardly or aimlessly he's  deliberately doing it as if it's some  kind of good policy it's very very scary  stuff today's episode of the program is  made possible in part by coin schedule  which is a listing site for  cryptocurrency icos that's been around  since 2016 and it was actually one of  the first websites to show helpful  listing information about icos where you  can look them up by name by industry by  start and end date and you'll get from  coin schedule a score for each IC o----  that can help you better assess how  careful you should be if you are looking  at investing in any particular IC o----  coin schedule like me says that they  hate scams and one of the guys from coin  schedule was actually telling me about  how they do everything they can to weed  out the scam IC o---- so that they  straight-up don't appear  their website and it seems that they've  learned a lot from doing this over the  past two years coin schedule is also a  really good resource for finding  information about upcoming  cryptocurrency related conferences they  also post crypto news and if you're  watching this on YouTube I put a link to  the coin schedule website at the top of  the description to be clear nothing on  coin schedule should be considered  personalized investment advice icos are  risky everybody should do their own  research and make the decisions that are  right for them

